OL,3,AUK drone factories may face attacks
OL,4,Afrom 'unknown sources' Putin tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrei Fedorov, an advisor to Vladimir
OL,7,FPutin, says there might be a
OL,8,F"semi-military" response against UK
OL,9,Fdrone factories by "unknown sources"
OL,10,Fover the sharing military blueprints
OL,11,Fwith Russia.
OL,13,FHis comments on BBC Newsnight come as
OL,14,FUK Prime Minister Andy Burnham says he
OL,15,Fplans to travel to the US next month
OL,16,Fwith European leaders to lobby US
OL,17,FPresident Trump on Ukraine's defence
OL,18,Fneeds.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
