OL,3,AUK drone factories may face attacks
OL,4,Afrom 'unknown sources' Putin tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an interview with Bloomberg, Burnham
OL,7,Fsaid, "I'm looking forward to going to
OL,8,FNew York in September," when the UN
OL,9,FGeneral Assembly will meet.
OL,11,FHe said that while the details were not
OL,12,F"fully confirmed", it is "likely" he
OL,13,Fwill go. The trip would be his first to
OL,14,Fthe US since becoming prime minister in
OL,15,FJuly.
